"When first enabling the tweak, enter the passcode next time you unlock your device!" = "首次启用插件后，请在下次解锁时输入一次真实密码！";
"Enable: enables or disables all features of this tweak.\nSave passcode across resprings: saves passcode so that you don't need to enter it once every respring. Your passcode will always be saved encrypted.\nShow last time unlocked: replaces title above passcode view with the last time the device was unlocked.\nUse 24h format: applies to last time unlocked and magic passcode." = "启用插件：启用或停用本插件的所有功能。\n跨注销保存密码：保存密码以便每次注销后无需重新输入，密码始终以加密方式保存。\n显示上次解锁时间：将密码输入界面的标题替换为上次解锁时间。\n使用 24 小时制：应用于上次解锁时间与魔法密码。";
"Use auto-unlock: bypasses the passcode lock when the device was unlocked within a certain period." = "使用自动解锁：设备在指定时间段内解锁过后，可跳过密码验证。";
"Use Wi-Fi auto-unlock: bypasses the passcode lock within a certain period when connected to specific Wi-Fi networks.\nEven when joined while locked: enables auto-unlock even if a WiFi network is joined while the phone is locked. Otherwise, the device has to be unlocked while connected to enable this feature." = "使用 Wi-Fi 自动解锁：连接指定 Wi-Fi 网络后，在指定时间段内可跳过密码验证。\n锁定状态下加入网络时同样生效：锁定状态下加入 Wi-Fi 网络时也启用自动解锁；否则需要设备在连接状态下解锁过一次才会启用该功能。";
"Use Bluetooth auto-unlock: bypasses the passcode lock within a certain period when connected to specific Bluetooth devices.\nEven when connected while locked: enables auto-unlock even if a Bluetooth device connects while the phone is locked. Otherwise, the device has to be unlocked while connected to enable this feature." = "使用蓝牙自动解锁：连接指定蓝牙设备后，在指定时间段内可跳过密码验证。\n锁定状态下连接时同样生效：锁定状态下连接蓝牙设备时也启用自动解锁；否则需要设备在连接状态下解锁过一次才会启用该功能。";
"Auto-unlock while using headphones: bypasses the passcode lock when headphones are connected (prior to locking).\nAuto-unlock while Watch is reachable: bypasses the passcode lock when the paired Apple Watch is nearby. Note: this does not currently check whether the Watch is unlocked.\nDismiss lockscreen if no notifications: skip the lockscreen when auto-unlocking if no notifications are showing.\nEven when showing media controls: skip the lockscreen when auto-unlocking even if the media control are showing." = "插入有线耳机时自动解锁：插入有线耳机后（锁定前已插入）可跳过密码验证。\nApple Watch 在附近时自动解锁：配对的 Apple Watch 在附近时可跳过密码验证；注意：目前不会检查手表本身是否已解锁。\n无通知时自动收起锁屏：自动解锁时若没有通知显示，直接收起锁屏。\n显示媒体控件时同样收起：自动解锁时即使正在显示媒体控件也直接收起锁屏。";
"Use Magic Passcode: gives the ability to unlock the device with a secondary passcode. If unlocked with this code, the auto-unlock feature will temporarily be disabled.\nPasscode length: disable the 6-digit option if using a 4-digit passcode.\nMagic Passcode configuration: use values from different sources — time, date, battery, timeout, or custom digits." = "使用魔法密码：允许使用另一组密码解锁设备；使用该密码解锁后，自动解锁功能将临时停用。\n密码位数：使用 4 位密码时请停用 6 位选项。\n魔法密码配置：数字来源可选——时间、日期、电量、超时或自定义数字。";
"Disable during SOS mode: disables auto-unlock and magic passcode when SOS mode is invoked (by pressing 5 times the lock button, which by default also disables Touch ID/Face ID).\nDisable during time interval: an interval of time during which auto-unlock and magic passcode will be disabled.\nAlso disable Touch ID/Face ID: whether to disable Touch ID/Face ID as well during this time interval.\nKeep disabled until next real unlock: keeps auto-unlock and magic passcode disabled even after the specified time interval, until the next passcode unlock (or via Touch ID/Face ID, if not disabled); the tweak is reenabled only by a login after the time interval.\nDisable \"PassBy Enabled\" alert: disables the alert after entering passcode for the first time (useful if you're not saving passcode over resprings)." = "SOS 模式下停用：触发 SOS 模式（连按 5 次锁屏键，默认同时停用触控 ID／面容 ID）时停用自动解锁与魔法密码。\n在指定时间段内停用：在此时间段内，自动解锁与魔法密码将被停用。\n同时停用触控 ID／面容 ID：是否在该时间段内同时停用触控 ID／面容 ID。\n保持停用直到下次真实解锁：即使超出指定时间段，自动解锁与魔法密码仍保持停用，直到下次通过密码（或未停用时的触控 ID／面容 ID）解锁；只有在时间结束之后的解锁才会重新启用插件。\n关闭「PassBy 已启用」提示：首次输入密码后不再弹出提示（在不跨注销保存密码时很有用）。";
